# VCP (Vauban Customer Portal)

Customer-facing web portal for **Vauban Cybersec** (sibling of the
bastion product in `../Vauban`). This repository is **not** the bastion
admin UI (`vauban-web`); do not import bastion IPC, proxy, privsep, or
bastion Casbin policy files unless the user explicitly asks.

Project short name: **VCP**. Use that name in paths, crates, package
scopes, and commit/PR titles unless a longer form is clearer.

## Purpose (current intent)

Internet-facing **CRUD customer portal** (HTTPS request/response — no
WebSocket product surface) for customers and operators of Vauban
deployments, for example:

- Account / organization onboarding and profile
- License, entitlement, and download access
- Support / ticket entry points
- Billing or subscription status (when wired)

Security bar on the wire matches the bastion for **TLS 1.3** and
**post-quantum hybrid readiness** (`tls-post-quantum.mdc`), without
importing bastion IPC / privsep.

Refine this list as product scope is confirmed; prefer thin vertical
slices over speculative features.

## Relationship to other repos

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `../Vauban` | Bastion product (Rust, Axum, Askama, …) |
